%[output:3569bda5]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":" <strong>title<\/strong> - Add title\n\n    <strong>Syntax<\/strong>\n      title(titletext)\n      title(titletext,subtitletext)\n      title(___,Name,Value)\n      title(target,___)\n      t = title(___)\n      [t,s] = title(___)\n\n    <strong>Input Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1-txt')\">titletext<\/a> - Title text\n        '' (default) | character vector | cell array of character vectors |\n        string array | categorical array | numeric value\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#mw_fe84c3e3-9402-4075-b695-48b1ac4ec71a')\">subtitletext<\/a> - Subtitle text\n        '' (default) | character vector | cell array of character vectors |\n        string array | categorical array | numeric value\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1-target')\">target<\/a> - Target for title\n        axes | legend | tiled chart layout | standalone visualization |\n        array of objects\n\n    <strong>Name-Value Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1_sep_mw_9b090ccc-eaa1-4018-9ac6-be5a933ac393')\">FontSize<\/a> - Font size\n        11 (default) | scalar value greater than 0\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1-FontWeight')\">FontWeight<\/a> - Thickness of text characters\n        'normal' | 'bold'\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1_sep_shared-FontName')\">FontName<\/a> - Font name\n        supported font name | \"FixedWidth\"\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1_sep_shared-Color')\">Color<\/a> - Text color\n        RGB triplet | hexadecimal color code | 'r' | 'g' | 'b' | ...\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1_sep_shared-Interpreter')\">Interpreter<\/a> - Text interpreter\n        \"tex\" (default) | \"latex\" | \"none\"\n\n    <strong>Output Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#btpi3rq-1-t')\">t<\/a> - Object used for title\n        text object | legend text object\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/title.html#mw_3f76aef5-3e98-44fe-b781-3294e88e3631')\">s<\/a> - Object used for subtitle\n        text object\n\n    <strong>Examples<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/AddTitletoCurrentFigureExample')\">Add Title to Current Axes<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/TitleWithSubtitleExample')\">Create Title and Subtitle<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/IncludeVariablesValueinTitleExample')\">Include Variable's Value in Title<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/CreateMulticoloredTitleUsingTeXMarkupExample')\">Create Multicolored Title Using TeX Markup<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/TitleLatexExample')\">Create Title with LaTeX Markup<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/CreateColoredTitleUsingNameValuePairArgumentExample')\">Create Colored Title Using Name,Value Pair Argument<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/IncludeGreekSymbolsinTitleExample')\">Include Greek Symbols in Title<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/IncludeSuperscriptorSubscriptCharacterinTitleExample')\">Include Superscript or Subscript Character in Title<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/CreateMultilineTitleExample')\">Create Multiline Title<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/DisplayTextAsTypedExample')\">Display Text As Typed<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/TitleSpecificAxes19bExample')\">Add Title to Specific Axes<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/AddTitleandReturnObjectHandleExample')\">Add Title and Return Text Handle<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('graphics\/TitleAlignmentExample')\">Change Title Alignment<\/a>\n\n    <strong>See also<\/strong> <a href=\"matlab:help xlabel -displayBanner\">xlabel<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help ylabel -displayBanner\">ylabel<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help zlabel -displayBanner\">zlabel<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help subtitle -displayBanner\">subtitle<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help matlab.graphics.primitive.Text -displayBanner\">Text<\/a>\n\n    Introduced in MATLAB before R2006a\n    <a href=\"matlab:doc title\">Documentation for title<\/a>\n\n","truncated":false}}
