%[output:05a2edb7]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":" <strong>size<\/strong> - Array size\n\n    <strong>Syntax<\/strong>\n      sz = size(A)\n      szdim = size(A,dim)\n      szdim = size(A,dim1,dim2,...,dimN)\n      [sz1,...,szN] = size(___)\n\n    <strong>Input Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/double.size.html#bvfgzsm-1-A')\">A<\/a> - Input array\n        scalar | vector | matrix | multidimensional array\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/double.size.html#bvfgzsm-1-dim')\">dim<\/a> - Queried dimensions\n        positive integer scalar | vector of positive integer scalars |\n        empty array\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/double.size.html#mw_dda7c7f5-9ad9-4379-a52f-253516c02f19')\">dim1,dim2,...,dimN<\/a> - List of queried dimensions\n        positive integer scalars\n\n    <strong>Output Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/double.size.html#bvfgzsm-1-sz')\">sz<\/a> - Array size\n        row vector of nonnegative integers\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/double.size.html#bvfgzsm-1-szdim')\">szdim<\/a> - Dimension lengths\n        nonnegative integer scalar | vector of nonnegative integer scalars |\n        1-by-0 empty array\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026a\\help\/matlab\/ref\/double.size.html#bvfgzsm-1-sz1szN')\">sz1,...,szN<\/a> - Dimension lengths listed separately\n        nonnegative integer scalars\n\n    <strong>Examples<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('matlab\/SizeofDimensionsin3DArrayExample')\">Size of 4-D Array<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('matlab\/SizeofTableExample')\">Size of Table<\/a>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('matlab\/SizeOfMatrixExample')\">Dimension Lengths as Separate Arguments<\/a>\n\n    <strong>See also<\/strong> <a href=\"matlab:help double.length -displayBanner\">length<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help strlength -displayBanner\">strlength<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help ndims -displayBanner\">ndims<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help double.numel -displayBanner\">numel<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help height -displayBanner\">height<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help width -displayBanner\">width<\/a>\n\n    Introduced in MATLAB before R2006a\n    <a href=\"matlab:doc matlab\/size\">Documentation for matlab\/size<\/a>\n    <a href=\"matlab:matlab.lang.internal.introspective.overloads.displayOverloads('size')\">Other uses of size<\/a>\n\n","truncated":false}}
